    "All 18 original source cases are covered exactly once across two sequential canonical-owner exports: South Pacific 10 (9 interior/1 gate edge) and South Australian 8 (6 interior/1 no qualification/1 upper-support edge). Retain each full native-resolution export under fixed 2.4 MB. January 15 and July 15, 2022 00Z are two individual model states, not seasonal means, annual bounds, quarters or occupations. Zero ocean retrieval.",
