    "Both original currents retain 90-degree eastward frame, 0.05 m/s primary at index0, 0.02 m/s surface gate, complete finite positive upper200m integral/core search and null thermal gate. All 15 interior and three distinct unresolved outcomes remain, without weaker core replacement, alternate cutoff fill, sign flip or forced austral-winter continuity. Surface qualification does not force the primary contour to zero depth.",
    "South Pacific remains partial eastern 103-88W reach; historical front sections, 14C-at-150m criterion and 3000m dynamic-height reference are not current axes, thermal gates or bottoms. South Australian remains partial 135.5-142.5E reach under the source naming convention, excluding Leeuwin/Zeehan/gulfs and sign-flipped summer reversal. Full upper200m support excludes shallow profiles; offshore recirculation/eddies and non-local along-slope direction remain identification limits. No family, branch or complete-route inheritance.",
    "Preserve strict four-native-axis-neighbor connectivity, separate runs, crossings and missing/domain/lateral censors without diagonal/missing bridges or reselection. Native brackets are not uncertainty, model support spans are not physical thickness, and missing/no qualification is not zero, seabed or named-current absence. No independently identified body/axis/water mass/physical bottom, annual extrema, whole-route profile, width/area/volume or new scalar refs.",
    "Preserve 808 heterogeneous depth references, all previous regional/fitted products, 102 eddy size references and main/runtime/UI. Profile-date counts are not independent observations.",
    "Cloud-only sequential one idle CPU: four original source checks plus 14 new checks and both actual builds. Tests block Dataset/urlopen, verify exact disjoint bounded original batches, entire validated function/selector identity, source-specific 5cm primary/2cm surface gates, two dates, original cores/boundaries, surface topology, source immutability and geometry/time/frame/diagnosis mutation rejection, plus distinct no-qualification/gate/support-edge outcomes. Local static editing/AST, metadata/hashes and exact retention only."
